m":21},{"book":"JOS","chapter":15,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"It proceeded to Azmon, joined the Brook of Egypt, and ended at the Sea. This was their southern border.","from":47},{"book":"1SA","chapter":17,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Now the Philistines gathered their forces for war at Socoh in Judah, and they camped between Socoh and Azekah in Ephes-dammim.","from":35},{"book":"1SA","chapter":22,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So David left Gath and took refuge in the cave of Adullam. When his brothers and the rest of his fatherʼs household heard about it, they went down to him there.","from":35},{"book":"1SA","chapter":27,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"That day Achish gave him Ziklag, and to this day it still belongs to the kings of Judah.","from":31}],"notes":[],"groups":[]}}